{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"huanchen-e-o158","title":"群言太祖复刘廙之位","accounts":[{"id":"huanchen-a-283877d0227f1646a677","label":"正文","text":"群言太祖复刘廙之位","evidence":["huanchen-q-d76b91f8893beaa0ab31"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0394","role":"言之太祖、答议刑为国非为私也且自明主之意吾何知焉、其弘博不伐","evidence":["huanchen-q-d76b91f8893beaa0ab31"]},{"person":"wendi-p0070","role":"坐弟与魏讽谋反当诛、乃复位、深德群","evidence":["huanchen-q-d76b91f8893beaa0ab31"]},{"person":"cao-cao","role":"曰廙名臣也吾亦欲赦之","evidence":["huanchen-q-d76b91f8893beaa0ab31"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["huanchen-q-d76b91f8893beaa0ab31"]},"ordering_evidence":"huanchen-q-d76b91f8893beaa0ab31","source_order":[22,203,6],"order":4524}],"persons":[{"id":"cao-cao","name":"曹操","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wendi-p0070","name":"刘廙","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"wudi-p0394","name":"陈群","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"huanchen-q-d76b91f8893beaa0ab31","section":"chapter-022","block":"b-9ede2096e17a9f1cedd1","layer":"original","quote":"初，太祖时，刘廙坐弟与魏讽谋反，当诛。群言之太祖，太祖曰：“廙，名臣也，吾亦欲赦之。”乃复位。廙深德群〖1〗，群曰：“夫议刑为国，非为私也；且自明主之意，吾何知焉？”其弘博不伐〖2〗，皆此类也。","section_title":"桓二陈徐卫卢传第二十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0050.xhtml","index":202,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":97,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
